                <pb facs="0240" n="178" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg178"/>

                <head>No. 122.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Hitt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-06-28"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 28,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hitt</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Chargé, Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>Inform by letter representatives of the United States in Europe that at a
                    conference of the United States monetary commissioners the 10th of August has
                    been suggested as the time for the meeting of the conference, instead of the
                    25th of July as heretofore proposed.</p>
                <closer><signed>EVARTS, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
